Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:09:00.16,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 国家银行公开赛（多伦多）决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:09:00.16,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}斯瓦泰克 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-2 6-3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 莱巴金娜 · 赛后新闻发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:02.22,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:02.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:05.26,EN,,0,0,0,,Got some strings for Cincinnati.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:05.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提要用的线拿到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:06.62,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:06.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:08.14,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll go ahead and get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:08.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 我们开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:09.18,EN,,0,0,0,,First question from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:09.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一个问题我来问
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:10.58,EN,,0,0,0,,Iga, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,伊加 恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:11.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Your first title here in Canada
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:11.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在加拿大的第一个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.94,0:00:13.50,EN,,0,0,0,,and your first title of 2026.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.94,0:00:13.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是你 2026 年的第一冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:16.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Just what does this this title mean to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:16.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个冠军对你意味着什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:19.74,EN,,0,0,0,,It means a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:19.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,意义很大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.74,0:00:21.58,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm speechless a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.74,0:00:21.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 我有点说不出话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:27.34,EN,,0,0,0,,because the journey has been bumpy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:27.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为这一路都很颠簸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.34,0:00:27.98,EN,,0,0,0,,this season.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.34,0:00:27.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:29.74,EN,,0,0,0,,So, to be here and to hold the trophy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:29.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以能站在这儿 捧起奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.74,0:00:30.74,EN,,0,0,0,,and to win against, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.74,0:00:30.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且是赢下了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.74,0:00:33.14,EN,,0,0,0,,the best players for sure means a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.74,0:00:33.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,最好的那些球员 意义当然很大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:34.78,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm just proud of myself
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:34.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,我为自己骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:38.30,EN,,0,0,0,,and super happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:38.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,也非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:43.38,EN,,0,0,0,,Hey Iga, congrats on the title.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:43.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,伊加 恭喜夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:44.38,EN,,0,0,0,,Just over the past year,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:44.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,过去这一年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:46.50,EN,,0,0,0,,obviously your last title was 11 months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:46.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,你上一个冠军是 11 个月前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:47.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Like how much did that kind of weigh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:47.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,这件事对你来说压力有多大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:50.30,EN,,0,0,0,,on you to not having been in the final
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:50.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直没能打进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:53.66,EN,,0,0,0,,and not having a title in like 11 months?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:53.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,十一个月没有拿到冠军？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.66,0:00:56.58,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't say it mattered this week,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.66,0:00:56.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不觉得这一周它有影响
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:00:58.94,EN,,0,0,0,,but overall, obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:00:58.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,但总体上说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.94,0:01:01.38,EN,,0,0,0,,we all work to to have these moments
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.94,0:01:01.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们努力就是为了这样的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:03.70,EN,,0,0,0,,and for sure I was missing it a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:03.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,我确实有点想念这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:06.34,EN,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I was impatient um throughout
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:06.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候我很没耐心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.34,0:01:06.90,EN,,0,0,0,,the season.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.34,0:01:06.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,整个赛季都是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:09.38,EN,,0,0,0,,I was like, you know, seeking it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:09.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直追着它跑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:13.62,EN,,0,0,0,,while maybe my game was not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:13.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,而我的球可能还没准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.62,0:01:15.30,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I'm happy at the end, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.62,0:01:15.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以最后我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.30,0:01:16.86,EN,,0,0,0,,I stayed focused on just grinding
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.30,0:01:16.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直专心在打磨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:17.82,EN,,0,0,0,,and improving
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:17.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,和进步上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:20.34,EN,,0,0,0,,because that's the most important thing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:20.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为那才是最重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.34,0:01:23.42,EN,,0,0,0,,and this season has been necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.34,0:01:23.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个赛季是必须经历的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.42,0:01:26.54,EN,,0,0,0,,Um and for sure this week my tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.42,0:01:26.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,而这一周我的球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:30.18,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, clicked physicality as well
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:30.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,对上了 体能也是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.18,0:01:32.34,EN,,0,0,0,,and the mental work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.18,0:01:32.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有心理这一块
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.34,0:01:37.78,EN,,0,0,0,,So, um for sure best week of the season
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.34,0:01:37.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,这肯定是本赛季最好的一周
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:40.90,EN,,0,0,0,,so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:40.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,到目前为止
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.30,0:01:43.38,EN,,0,0,0,,Iga, congrats on the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.30,0:01:43.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,伊加 恭喜获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:43.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:43.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:45.10,EN,,0,0,0,,You were saying after the match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:45.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,你赛后说过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.10,0:01:46.46,EN,,0,0,0,,that this was the first time you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.10,0:01:46.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是你第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:49.38,EN,,0,0,0,,were feeling anger as an emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:49.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,感受到愤怒这种情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:52.58,EN,,0,0,0,,Um I was just wondering did you see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:52.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想知道的是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.58,0:01:54.78,EN,,0,0,0,,a value in that anger over the course
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.58,0:01:54.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,这股怒气在这个周末的比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.78,0:01:56.18,EN,,0,0,0,,of this weekend playing with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.78,0:01:56.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,是有价值的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.18,0:01:57.30,EN,,0,0,0,,And do you think that's something
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.18,0:01:57.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得这是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:01:58.94,EN,,0,0,0,,that you maybe want to keep
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:01:58.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,你想一直带着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:00.02,EN,,0,0,0,,with you going forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:00.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,走下去的东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.02,0:02:02.22,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I didn't feel it during the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.02,0:02:02.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,比赛期间我其实没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:06.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Um I guess now I mean, after I won,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:06.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想现在 我是说 赢下来之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.86,0:02:09.82,EN,,0,0,0,,um I kind of let myself feel it a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.86,0:02:09.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,我才让自己稍微感受了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:12.38,EN,,0,0,0,,because um yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:12.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:13.38,EN,,0,0,0,,uh as I said in the speech,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:13.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在致辞里也说过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.38,0:02:14.98,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, there are plenty of things
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.38,0:02:14.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,有很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.98,0:02:17.50,EN,,0,0,0,,that uh athletes and not only athletes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.98,0:02:17.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,运动员 不只是运动员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:19.74,EN,,0,0,0,,uh all the people have to struggle with.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:19.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有人都要面对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:24.78,EN,,0,0,0,,Um And uh and sometimes we need
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:24.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,而有时候我们不得不
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.78,0:02:27.46,EN,,0,0,0,,to fight things that we shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.78,0:02:27.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,去对抗本不该对抗的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.46,0:02:31.10,EN,,0,0,0,,Um and that's why I'm even more proud
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.46,0:02:31.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我更为自己骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.10,0:02:34.38,EN,,0,0,0,,of myself that I I focused on my path
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.10,0:02:34.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,我专注在自己的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:38.98,EN,,0,0,0,,and I didn't let that to define me and um
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:38.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有让那些东西定义我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.98,0:02:43.90,EN,,0,0,0,,and um I believe that I know what my game
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.98,0:02:43.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,我相信我知道我的球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.90,0:02:46.26,EN,,0,0,0,,is worth and I just need to focus
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.90,0:02:46.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,值多少 我只需要专注
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.26,0:02:47.90,EN,,0,0,0,,on the right stuff, do the right work,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.26,0:02:47.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,在对的事情上 做对的功课
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:54.46,EN,,0,0,0,,and and the bright days will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:54.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,好日子自然会来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:56.42,EN,,0,0,0,,Hi Iga, congratulations on your win.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:56.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,伊加 恭喜你夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:56.82,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:56.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.82,0:02:58.22,EN,,0,0,0,,It felt like you had the crowd support
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.82,0:02:58.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉这六场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:03:00.02,EN,,0,0,0,,for all six of your matches here in Toronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:03:00.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,多伦多的观众一直在支持你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.02,0:03:01.30,EN,,0,0,0,,I know I know you arrived here early
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.02,0:03:01.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道你提前就到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.30,0:03:03.22,EN,,0,0,0,,to experience a little bit of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.30,0:03:03.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,想感受一下这座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.22,0:03:04.42,EN,,0,0,0,,What was it like to kind
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.22,0:03:04.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,在多伦多的这段日子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:05.62,EN,,0,0,0,,of be here in the in Toronto
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:05.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:08.86,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh what were the what was the what
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:08.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有这一周半下来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.86,0:03:10.86,EN,,0,0,0,,were the fans like uh over the course
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.86,0:03:10.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里的球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:12.14,EN,,0,0,0,,of the week and a half?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:12.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,给你什么感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:13.02,EN,,0,0,0,,They were amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:13.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:15.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Like you could hear um sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:15.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候你能听见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:18.94,EN,,0,0,0,,a little bit wild and uh screaming
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:18.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们有点野 会在不该喊的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.94,0:03:21.22,EN,,0,0,0,,in unnecessary moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.94,0:03:21.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,喊出声
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:23.54,EN,,0,0,0,,But besides um really supportive,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:23.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,但除此之外 他们非常支持我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:26.26,EN,,0,0,0,,I heard many great things from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:26.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,我从他们那儿听到很多好话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:28.86,EN,,0,0,0,,And this is the the best thing you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:28.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是你在一站比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:30.90,EN,,0,0,0,,can experience on on the tournaments.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:30.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,能体验到的最好的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.90,0:03:34.14,EN,,0,0,0,,Also, like after the matches,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.90,0:03:34.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且每场比赛之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.14,0:03:36.34,EN,,0,0,0,,I had opportunity to always sign
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.14,0:03:36.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,我都有机会签名
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.34,0:03:39.42,EN,,0,0,0,,and to be close to them and they I felt
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.34,0:03:39.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,离他们很近 我感受到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.42,0:03:41.06,EN,,0,0,0,,the support and I felt the love.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.42,0:03:41.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种支持 那种爱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.06,0:03:42.98,EN,,0,0,0,,I heard like at the beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.06,0:03:42.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在赛事一开始就听说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.98,0:03:43.54,EN,,0,0,0,,of the tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.98,0:03:43.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:45.22,EN,,0,0,0,,that there's like big Polish community here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:45.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,一个很大的波兰人社区
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:47.02,EN,,0,0,0,,but I didn't know it's it's that big.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:47.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我没想到有这么大
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:48.82,EN,,0,0,0,,Half of the stadium was probably Polish,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:48.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,球场里大概有一半是波兰人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:51.38,EN,,0,0,0,,so um really appreciate that and for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:51.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很感激
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.38,0:03:53.70,EN,,0,0,0,,sure it gives you extra energy um
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.38,0:03:53.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,这会给你额外的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:58.54,EN,,0,0,0,,and I felt it on the games.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在场上感受到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:00.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Again, congratulations, Iga.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:00.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,再次恭喜你 伊加
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.94,0:04:01.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.94,0:04:01.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.30,0:04:02.54,EN,,0,0,0,,just go back a minute
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.30,0:04:02.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,想再回到刚才
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:05.26,EN,,0,0,0,,to your previous answer and what you said
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:05.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,你上一个回答 还有你在场上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:07.86,EN,,0,0,0,,on the court about being angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:07.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,说到愤怒那一段
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.86,0:04:08.38,EN,,0,0,0,,For those of us
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.86,0:04:08.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我们这些
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.38,0:04:09.54,EN,,0,0,0,,who don't quite understand what you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.38,0:04:09.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,不太明白你在说什么的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:12.06,EN,,0,0,0,,were talking about, can you clarify what
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:12.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,你能不能说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:15.14,EN,,0,0,0,,was making you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:15.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,是什么让你生气？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:18.06,EN,,0,0,0,,Um well, the all the things
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:18.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是那些事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.06,0:04:20.42,EN,,0,0,0,,that I I men I mentioned in the speech like
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.06,0:04:20.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在致辞里提到的那些
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:24.70,EN,,0,0,0,,this unfair judgment and um sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:24.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种不公的评判
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:27.98,EN,,0,0,0,,the like people just judging
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:27.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候就是有人评头论足
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.98,0:04:31.22,EN,,0,0,0,,and hating um but you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.98,0:04:31.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有恶意 但你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:35.06,EN,,0,0,0,,it's good to focus on how to create space
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:35.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,更好的做法是想办法留出空间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:40.18,EN,,0,0,0,,for you to just focus on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:40.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,让自己只专注在自己身上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:43.10,EN,,0,0,0,,It's not so easy to do that, but um
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:43.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,这不容易做到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.10,0:04:47.30,EN,,0,0,0,,but like the best thing about this two weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.10,0:04:47.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,但这两周最好的一点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:50.58,EN,,0,0,0,,for me was that I could kind of let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:50.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,是我多少能把它放下了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.58,0:04:51.22,EN,,0,0,0,,This yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.58,0:04:51.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,对 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.22,0:04:53.70,EN,,0,0,0,,this anger came like after I won uh
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.22,0:04:53.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,这股怒气是我赢了之后才来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:55.30,EN,,0,0,0,,but during the whole process I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:55.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,但整个过程里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.30,0:04:57.18,EN,,0,0,0,,was really focused on just growing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.30,0:04:57.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的只专注在成长
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:04:59.46,EN,,0,0,0,,and progressing and the same happened
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:04:59.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,和进步上 温网之后也是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:01.74,EN,,0,0,0,,after Wimbledon when I started, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:01.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,那时候我开始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:02.94,EN,,0,0,0,,practicing on hard courts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:02.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,练硬地
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:05.98,EN,,0,0,0,,So for sure I feel like uh I worked hard
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:05.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我觉得我下了很大功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:10.18,EN,,0,0,0,,to um to kind of all this noise
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:10.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,去应付这些噪音
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:12.34,EN,,0,0,0,,and unnecessary noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:12.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,那些没必要的噪音
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.34,0:05:13.58,EN,,0,0,0,,That's what makes me angry
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.34,0:05:13.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,那才是让我生气的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:14.54,EN,,0,0,0,,because it shouldn't be like
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:14.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为本不该是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:15.74,EN,,0,0,0,,that and it doesn't need to be like
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:15.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,也不需要是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.74,0:05:17.46,EN,,0,0,0,,that, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.74,0:05:17.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,你懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:19.70,EN,,0,0,0,,You mean like on social media or
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:19.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是指社交媒体上 还是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:23.10,EN,,0,0,0,,um well, if you would be Polish,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:23.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,呃 如果你是波兰人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.10,0:05:26.30,EN,,0,0,0,,you would know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.10,0:05:26.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,你就懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:31.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Wondering if you can describe a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:31.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,想请你讲讲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.86,0:05:34.90,EN,,0,0,0,,your winning reaction once you captured
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.86,0:05:34.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿下赛点的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:35.82,EN,,0,0,0,,match point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:35.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的反应
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:37.66,EN,,0,0,0,,You started with a big smile on your face
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:37.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,你先是笑得很开
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.66,0:05:39.18,EN,,0,0,0,,and then looked immediately to your team
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.66,0:05:39.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后立刻看向你的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.18,0:05:40.78,EN,,0,0,0,,and pointed to your head and and look
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.18,0:05:40.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,指了指自己的头 表情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.78,0:05:43.62,EN,,0,0,0,,so intense and just so dialed in and fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.78,0:05:43.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,特别专注 特别有劲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:44.90,EN,,0,0,0,,Can you explain the emotions
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:44.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,能说说那两个瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.90,0:05:46.42,EN,,0,0,0,,that were going through your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.90,0:05:46.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,你脑子里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.42,0:05:47.38,EN,,0,0,0,,in those two moments?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.42,0:05:47.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,都是什么情绪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:48.78,EN,,0,0,0,,You kind of explained them well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:48.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,你其实说得挺准的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:50.22,EN,,0,0,0,,I was really fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:50.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,我当时特别有劲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:55.74,EN,,0,0,0,,Um just so I kept my composure till
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:55.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直保持着冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:57.50,EN,,0,0,0,,the end even though there were moments
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:57.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,直到最后 尽管这一站里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:05:58.38,EN,,0,0,0,,during the tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:05:58.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,有些时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:00.34,EN,,0,0,0,,where I lost the level a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:00.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的水平掉了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:02.54,EN,,0,0,0,,or I had a little bit of doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:02.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,也有过一点怀疑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.54,0:06:05.46,EN,,0,0,0,,Um in the final today I was certain what
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.54,0:06:05.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,但今天决赛我很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.46,0:06:08.26,EN,,0,0,0,,to do and how to use all my strengths
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.46,0:06:08.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,该做什么 怎么用上我的长处
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:11.26,EN,,0,0,0,,and um I felt during the whole week
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:11.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,整整一周我的感觉都是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:13.66,EN,,0,0,0,,my mentality was in a good place
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:13.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的心态很好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:16.38,EN,,0,0,0,,and I reacted well to, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:16.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,我应对得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:17.54,EN,,0,0,0,,positive things that came
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:17.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,对那些好的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:19.78,EN,,0,0,0,,but also to the challenges
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:19.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,也对那些挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.78,0:06:22.30,EN,,0,0,0,,and could solve problem solve basically
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.78,0:06:22.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,基本上每一场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:24.74,EN,,0,0,0,,on every match and um
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:24.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,我都能解决问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.74,0:06:26.02,EN,,0,0,0,,that really gave me confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.74,0:06:26.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,这给了我很大信心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.02,0:06:30.18,EN,,0,0,0,,So that's why I pointed to the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.02,0:06:30.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我才指了指脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:31.58,EN,,0,0,0,,Iga, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:31.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,伊加 恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.58,0:06:32.90,EN,,0,0,0,,Just on the match today,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.58,0:06:32.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,说回今天这场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:34.66,EN,,0,0,0,,you entered this match losing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:34.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,你之前对莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.66,0:06:36.46,EN,,0,0,0,,the two previous matches to Elena.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.66,0:06:36.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,连输了两场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.46,0:06:38.86,EN,,0,0,0,,So I'm just curious what changed going
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.46,0:06:38.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我想问 今天有什么不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:40.30,EN,,0,0,0,,into today's match in terms
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:40.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,在打法上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.30,0:06:41.70,EN,,0,0,0,,of how you approach this match up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.30,0:06:41.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,你怎么准备这个对阵
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.70,0:06:42.70,EN,,0,0,0,,and how proud you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.70,0:06:42.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有今天的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.70,0:06:46.06,EN,,0,0,0,,were of today's performance against Elena.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.70,0:06:46.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,让你有多骄傲？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.06,0:06:47.82,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, she's a really tough opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.06,0:06:47.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,她是非常难打的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.82,0:06:49.14,EN,,0,0,0,,Um if she plays her best game,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.82,0:06:49.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果她打出最好的球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:51.22,EN,,0,0,0,,she's probably better than everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:51.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,她大概比谁都强
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.22,0:06:51.54,EN,,0,0,0,,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.22,0:06:51.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:52.98,EN,,0,0,0,,So um you need
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:52.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以你必须
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:54.18,EN,,0,0,0,,to use all the opportunities.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:54.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,抓住每一个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:56.50,EN,,0,0,0,,You can't let yourself make mistakes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:56.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,不能让自己犯错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:58.02,EN,,0,0,0,,or bad decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:58.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者做出糟糕的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:07:00.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Um so I was really in the zone today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:07:00.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天我完全进入了状态
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.30,0:07:01.98,EN,,0,0,0,,I wanted to make the match physical
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.30,0:07:01.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想把这场球打成体力战
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:05.82,EN,,0,0,0,,and um yeah, to use my top spin
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:05.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有用上我的上旋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:08.42,EN,,0,0,0,,and to remember that I have a game
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,提醒自己 我的球
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:11.66,EN,,0,0,0,,that that I can control with the spin
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:11.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,可以靠旋转去控制
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:14.70,EN,,0,0,0,,and with the curve that the ball has.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:14.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,靠球的那一道弧线
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:15.46,EN,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:15.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:18.58,EN,,0,0,0,,in these conditions also I found confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:18.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这种条件下 我也有了信心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:23.50,EN,,0,0,0,,in that and um yeah, but you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:23.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:25.42,EN,,0,0,0,,any match against her is tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:25.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟她打哪一场都难
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:27.54,EN,,0,0,0,,especially knowing how she serves
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:27.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是她的发球
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:29.82,EN,,0,0,0,,and she can win so many points for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:29.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,能白白拿下那么多分
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:30.98,EN,,0,0,0,,You need to really stay patient
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:30.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,你必须非常有耐心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:33.66,EN,,0,0,0,,and um don't let that annoy you a little bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:33.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,别让那件事影响到你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:36.74,EN,,0,0,0,,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:36.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,你懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.86,0:07:39.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Hey there, you have a 26 and five record
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.86,0:07:39.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,你现在决赛的战绩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:40.54,EN,,0,0,0,,in finals now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:40.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,是 26 胜 5 负
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:42.18,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm just wondering what allows you to play
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:42.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想问是什么让你能
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:45.50,EN,,0,0,0,,your best tennis when it matters most.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:45.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,在最关键时刻打出最好的球？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.50,0:07:48.14,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, um I don't really know why
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.50,0:07:48.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也说不太清为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:50.14,EN,,0,0,0,,because I tried to approach this matches
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:50.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我尽量用同样的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.14,0:07:52.94,EN,,0,0,0,,the last matches the same as the ones
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.14,0:07:52.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,去准备最后这几场
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.94,0:07:55.38,EN,,0,0,0,,before because I know what I did right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.94,0:07:55.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟之前一样 我知道做对了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:57.82,EN,,0,0,0,,I I'm just trying to like continue that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:57.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只是想把它延续下去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:08:02.34,EN,,0,0,0,,I guess if I'm in the final it means
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:08:02.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想 能打进决赛就说明
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:04.06,EN,,0,0,0,,that my game is good
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:04.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的球状态不错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:08.46,EN,,0,0,0,,and that gives me confidence for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:08.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,这当然会给我信心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:09.02,EN,,0,0,0,,It means also
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:09.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,也说明
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.02,0:08:11.66,EN,,0,0,0,,that I played like some matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.02,0:08:11.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,我已经打了好几场
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:13.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Some were probably tough, some were not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:13.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,有的难打 有的不难
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.50,0:08:17.06,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I know I just know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.50,0:08:17.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我知道该做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.06,0:08:18.22,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm already in the rhythm
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.06,0:08:18.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,我已经进入节奏了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:20.66,EN,,0,0,0,,and um I guess the focus
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:20.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想还有专注
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:24.70,EN,,0,0,0,,and not letting you like your head go
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:24.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,别让自己的脑子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.70,0:08:27.98,EN,,0,0,0,,to places where it can distract you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.70,0:08:27.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,跑到那些会分散注意力的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:29.14,EN,,0,0,0,,to be in the final, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:29.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,打进决赛之后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.14,0:08:31.02,EN,,0,0,0,,and you can feel the pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.14,0:08:31.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是能感觉到压力的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.02,0:08:32.74,EN,,0,0,0,,Um you know, you need to go all
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.02,0:08:32.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,你必须全力以赴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:34.26,EN,,0,0,0,,in if you want to win the tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:34.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果你想拿下这一站
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:36.30,EN,,0,0,0,,because you're going to face the best player
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:36.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为决赛里 你面对的会是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:36.98,EN,,0,0,0,,in the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:36.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,最好的那个球员
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.98,0:08:38.86,EN,,0,0,0,,So, just trying to focus on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.98,0:08:38.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我尽量专注在这上面
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.86,0:08:40.62,EN,,0,0,0,,Obviously, sometimes it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.86,0:08:40.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然 有时候做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:42.62,EN,,0,0,0,,Sometimes there are finals
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:42.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,有些决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.62,0:08:45.42,EN,,0,0,0,,or other matches where it's just hard
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.62,0:08:45.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者别的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:46.38,EN,,0,0,0,,to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:46.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是很难应付
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:49.26,EN,,0,0,0,,Um but but you need to always try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:49.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你总得去试
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:50.46,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:50.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:53.10,EN,,0,0,0,,that most of times it went good for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:53.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,大多数时候结果对我是好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:54.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll leave it there and here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:54.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 今天就到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:57.90,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:57.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:09:00.16,EN,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:09:00.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,回头见
